Foreword 

This Side Story was published over a period of 9 months in Comic Alive, and is my favourite story in Re: Zero, period. I’ve tried to do my best to translate it, and I hope everyone reading it will enjoy it, Stride is without a doubt my favourite character in the series. The story takes place straight after the end of EX 3, and is its sequel. One day it should be adapted as an EX Story. I advise everyone to also read the Translation Notes interspersed in the document because they will explain some translation decisions, and will have some interesting speculation dotted around.

You can download the EPUB version by clicking “File > Download > Epub Publication.”

