Carol:「A sadistic criminal ruled by a doctrine of destruction and fleeting moments of hedonism... You think he’s like that?」

 (TL Note: 愉快犯 doesn’t really seem to have an English equivalent. It refers to a criminal who takes pleasure in people’s reactions to their crimes, more or less. I opted to use the word sadistic but that’s not the exact nuance, so bear that in mind.)

