Theresia:「I know that my Divine Protection hasn’t moved onto the next generation though...」

The『Divine Protection of the Sword Saint』was a special kind of Divine Protection that passed between the people in the Astrea Family generation after generation. Theresia had inherited the Divine Protection from her late uncle, who’d been the previous『Sword Saint.』Thus, she was prepared that someday, a time would come where this Divine Protection of her’s would leave her. But that wasn’t what had happened right now.  

