Wilhelm:「Your honoured Mother’s original name was Julia, wasn’t it? I first found out about it from her epitaph」

Karl:「It’s an unspoken agreement for us to hide our former names after we change them. Though you know, sometimes you might be able to tell a spouse, or a very close friend about it」

