Wilhelm:「Karl Mathers-dono」

Karl stopped in his tracks, and then turned around. Wilhelm continued his words. 

Wilhelm:「Thank you. Both you, and your Honoured Mother, thank you. ――I’m much obliged. For everything you’ve done」

Karl:「――」

