Miklotov:「――I’d say all of these precautions are unnecessary. Don’t you think so?」

???:「You’re asking that to me? ... Don’t push your luck, boy」

The person sitting in front of Miklotov replied to his casual tone with displeasure. He was a man with a large build, like, his body was, without exaggeration, huge. He was sitting directly on the floor rather than a sofa.  

