Miklotov:「If we rephrase it to say that depending on your last resort as a result of a stalemate is to be reckless, then no I don’t think so. You had a plan B, you had something else up your sleeve… And this time around, we were saved by it」

Miklotov cast his gaze down and let a modicum of gratitude trickle into his words. His opponent frowned in annoyance as soon as he sensed that and let out an awfully loud tch.
