Would an answer ever emerge someday whilst he was subject to his hatred, his curses and his flames of anger? 

Miklotov:「…Hmmm. What a thankless role this is, even though I asked for it」

Miklotov muttered this to himself just before he left the room and then let out a brief sigh.

